STed2 upstream license (as recorded in sted2-2.07m+20010303/debian/copyright,
per the original author's notice):

    Right for modification and improvement is granted. However it is
    requested that when a modified version is publicly released, the
    accompanying DOC and HIS files are distributed along with it.

This fork honours the obligation by preserving the original 1996 manuals
and history files under sted2-2.07m+20010303/doc/original_docs/ (in the
original Shift-JIS / EUC-JP encoding). Anyone redistributing this repo
is expected to keep that directory intact.

Changes introduced by this fork (2026-) are offered under the same terms.

Third-party notation glyphs
---------------------------

The 1bpp bitmaps in sted2-2.07m+20010303/sted2/sub/xwin_graph.c (treble
and bass clefs, note heads, flags, rests, sharp, flat, augmentation dot)
are extracted from renderings of the MusiXTeX package's musixmf font.
See NOTICE for attribution and license references.

Original authors
